  "migrationNotes": [
    "anatomy.body.male: skin uses the v1 non-skin colour \"dove\"; matched to White — check it on the stage",
    "clothes.torso.longsleeve: tint has no effect on clothes/longsleeve/longsleeve/male (its art is not in the cloth palette); it keeps its own colours",
    "clothes.wrists.lace: tint has no effect on wrists/lace/male (its art is not in the cloth palette); it keeps its own colours",
    "clothes.hands.gloves: dropped — arms already holds clothes.wrists.lace (the game has one arms item)",
    "clothes.trim.trim: skipped — cape trim: v1 draws it over the cape; the game holds one cape item (cape/trim is a separate cape)",
    "equipment.staffs.diamond: tint has no effect on magic/diamond/universal (its art is not in the metal palette); it keeps its own colours",
    "equipment.staff_accessory.crystal: dropped — weapon already holds equipment.staffs.diamond (the game has one weapon item)",
    "anatomy.shadow.shadow: skipped — shadow: the game draws its own shadow (no shadow slot in the catalogue)"
